+// GET /api/instruments/:id/reservations — 予約（取消を含む） / POST — 予約する（本文 { startOn, endOn }。予約するのはログイン中の本人）。
+import { NextResponse } from "next/server";
+import { jsonError, readJson, requireApiUser } from "@/lib/api";
+import { todayJst } from "@/lib/dates";
+import { getInstrument, parseId } from "@/lib/instruments";
+import { createReservation, listReservations, validateReservationInput } from "@/lib/reservations";
+
+type Context = { params: Promise<{ id: string }> };
+
+export async function GET(_request: Request, { params }: Context) {
+  const user = await requireApiUser();
+  if (user instanceof NextResponse) return user;
+  const id = parseId((await params).id);
+  if (id === undefined || !getInstrument(id)) return jsonError(404, "計測器が見つかりません");
+  return NextResponse.json({ reservations: listReservations(id) });
+}
+
+const CONFLICT_MESSAGES = {
+  not_reservable: "使用停止・廃棄の計測器は予約できません",
+  on_loan: "貸出中の計測器は、返却予定日の翌日から予約できます",
+  conflict: "その期間にはほかの予約があります",
+} as const;
+
+export async function POST(request: Request, { params }: Context) {
+  const user = await requireApiUser();
+  if (user instanceof NextResponse) return user;
+  const id = parseId((await params).id);
+  if (id === undefined || !getInstrument(id)) return jsonError(404, "計測器が見つかりません");
+  const now = new Date();
+  const input = validateReservationInput(await readJson(request), todayJst(now));
+  if (!input.ok) return jsonError(400, "入力内容に誤りがあります", input.errors);
+  const result = createReservation(id, user.id, input.value, undefined, now);
+  if (!result.ok) {
+    return result.reason === "not_found" ? jsonError(404, "計測器が見つかりません") : jsonError(409, CONFLICT_MESSAGES[result.reason]);
+  }
+  return NextResponse.json({ reservation: result.reservation }, { status: 201 });
+}
